('f0c7f657-0da2-481a-80bf-1c7d94e1392b', null, 'public_demo', 8, '## Data model

The database has five main tables: workspaces, members, notes, decisions and action items. A decision links to the note it came from, the people involved and a date. An action item links to a note, an owner and a due date. Deleting a note marks its decisions as "source removed" instead of deleting them, so the decision history is never silently lost.', '[-0.036362,0.007797,0.023373,-0.010018,-0.0022,-0.014275,0.032837,0.003341,0.079524,0.009921,0.054463,0.078403,0.005708,-0.01133,-0.046126,-0.038043,-0.048219,-0.012666,0.009309,0.025916,0.021453,-0.015608,-0.02133,0.005816,0.062434,0.059186,0.03499,-0.037254,-0.06523,-0.209217,-0.00737,0.008513,0.037255,-0.012348,0.001516,-0.015567,0.035046,0.023701,-0.060896,0.033466,0.04501,0.045574,0.041488,-0.011023,0.007996,-0.015214,0.028138,-0.036471,0.032258,0.002433,0.003389,-0.015868,-0.109021,0.062656,0.016576,0.011629,0.120791,0.080414,0.009951,0.02737,0.026781,0.003528,-0.134156,0.077411,-0.040344,0.035495,0.018037,-0.027013,-0.018362,0.043806,-0.051055,0.004579,-0.048902,0.021051,0.006365,-0.050866,-0.006682,-0.003863,-0.007083,-0.02418,-0.04656,-0.047631,0.004658,0.00221,0.005426,-0.005292,-0.050433,-0.034923,-0.024276,-0.007988,0.050945,0.012979,0.039402,0.048014,-0.061169,-0.004022,-0.013396,0.024221,-0.027569,0.381274,-0.06557,0.027204,-0.004396,-0.00398,-0.027765,-0.038621,-0.002902,-0.072013,-0.007876,0.02127,0.021899,0.019438,0.01961,-0.024928,0.01398,0.00178,0.020036,0.029714,0.012659,-0.030741,-0.031938,0.012424,0.068318,0.061034,0.033714,0.010327,0.024361,0.057273,0.05611,-0.009841,0.017014,-0.032584,-0.080996,-0.032268,0.007232,-0.002646,0.063475,-0.033243,-0.024283,-0.048964,-0.014052,0.03404,0.032719,-0.026823,-0.100372,0.154704,0.003286,-0.003334,-0.008228,0.022113,-0.021542,0.087191,0.039815,0.000687,-0.008194,0.062742,-0.021674,-0.040497,-0.060354,-0.005833,-0.020744,-0.040848,-0.010227,0.082744,-0.047324,-0.079017,-0.03384,0.026091,0.025651,-0.002303,0.028322,-0.004182,-0.056956,0.020523,0.035318,0.005