 Notes (Q3) > Budget review'),
('6e092003-e13e-4e6d-882a-1f256b3a69aa', null, 'public_demo', 7, '## Customer feedback summary

Tom summarised feedback from the 12 teams that tried the early prototype:

- Ten teams liked the plain-language search and described it as "the part that feels like magic".
- Seven teams wanted a calendar integration, which is why the decision to postpone it was discussed at length.
- Five teams found the extracted decisions too detailed, and asked for shorter summaries.
- Three teams asked for a way to export all notes, which is already planned.', '[-0.088485,0.037601,0.008173,-0.029809,-0.011421,0.010246,-0.090199,0.058731,0.011978,-0.007153,0.014237,0.041121,0.016395,0.003716,-0.007996,-0.041743,-0.022693,-0.131477,0.021411,0.010685,0.01152,-0.024545,0.00736,-0.024561,0.011773,0.003802,-0.020325,-0.068311,-0.048007,-0.196891,-0.039332,0.018861,0.096776,0.012378,0.025753,0.033388,0.029901,0.002852,-0.008659,0.011352,-0.013814,0.024832,-0.042053,-0.001832,0.038803,-0.050968,0.028826,0.001969,-0.042567,0.047708,0.005205,-0.038892,-0.00665,-0.000875,-0.01344,0.101373,-0.02005,0.06751,0.02469,0.017847,0.060909,-0.009187,-0.127924,0.089016,-0.033644,0.061581,-0.066175,-0.040531,-0.030531,0.075919,-0.022761,0.03319,0.027069,0.014863,0.019145,0.058194,0.020547,-0.006888,0.024285,-0.032002,-0.047663,-0.000697,-0.018504,-0.041163,-0.018584,-0.009675,-0.004103,0.049259,0.025775,-0.001396,0.079033,0.02342,-0.001281,0.010646,-0.089527,-0.031921,-0.00022,-0.027834,-0.030051,0.458069,0.011432,0.059557,0.046641,-0.022597,-0.012763,-0.034476,0.048047,-0.068985,0.004049,0.003343,0.011725,0.027169,0.047159,-0.040745,0.025515,0.036803,-0.019077,0.004589,0.010399,-0.013042,0.020968,0.050921,0.024286,-0.028636,-0.011101,0.016749,0.058761,0.025349,-0.009829,0.04349,0.039021,-0.021748,-0.028811,0.00478,0.026943,-0.022367,-0.035636,-0.067814,0.059435,0.034434,0.010343,-0.005066,0.020929,-0.056123,-0.065109,0.109971,0.021511,-0.014614,0.03863,0.017043,0.007562,0.06626,0.023076,-0.036873,-0.011001,0.02246,0.028137,0.043788,-0.051302,0.039092,-0.00371,0.003599,-0.009198,0.047621,0.00356,-0.113248,-0.030307,-0.004095,0.009546,-0.0278,-0.047606,-0.009854,-0.00939,0.020688,0.023114,0.016137,-0.02085,-0.026512,0.040507,0.012366,0.032106,0.025628,0.025312,0.015297,-0.038655,-0.02807,-0.028698,-0.051013,-0.012481,0.028843,-0.058994,-0.083774,-0.016454,0.111582,-0.013917,-0.020625,0.000203,-0.041349,-0.029431,0.005964,-0.036947,-0.03041,-0.012513,0.044284,0.026264