('4a2cc873-e4d0-47af-ae3e-26edf2c04a84', null, 'public_demo', 8, '## Customer research findings

We interviewed 24 project leads between March and May. Nineteen of them said they lose track of decisions at least once a month. Fourteen said the biggest cost is repeating a discussion that already happened. Only six use any dedicated tool for notes; most rely on shared documents and chat history.

When asked what would make them switch, the most common answer was "search that actually finds the thing I half remember". The second most common was "no extra work after the meeting".', '[-0.020097,0.016424,-0.010288,-0.007609,0.012597,-0.023882,-0.023434,0.001607,0.007204,-0.020448,0.03188,0.09327,0.011089,-0.01035,0.015497,0.027911,-0.034582,-0.094323,0.044476,0.043571,0.010918,-0.022074,-0.012568,0.026348,0.001666,0.02655,-0.025371,-0.094948,-0.052657,-0.1574,-0.023366,0.034664,0.079689,0.017835,0.023423,0.039601,0.028407,0.031047,0.004951,0.011053,-0.016127,-0.02681,0.009396,-0.014507,-0.00888,-0.005079,0.009649,-0.059183,-0.011664,0.034493,-0.006924,-0.046508,-0.011383,-0.002059,-0.003911,0.056052,0.034176,0.012062,-0.002615,-0.015679,0.033083,-0.068455,-0.178609,0.017922,-0.003848,0.054068,-0.043108,-0.058582,-0.062993,0.067477,-0.003722,0.003424,-0.043796,0.005561,0.063908,0.016173,-0.032484,-0.004022,0.063519,-0.053622,-0.024039,0.041788,-0.003136,-0.003612,0.013356,-0.073224,0.024272,0.044112,0.004238,-0.013118,0.067727,-0.012412,-0.01138,0.010058,-0.068278,-0.009532,0.017879,0.034416,-0.069596,0.466848,-0.027681,0.041108,0.006689,-0.023437,-0.04803,-0.053463,0.013192,-0.032442,0.016986,0.038706,0.018138,0.019058,0.014412,-0.100309,0.050248,0.041665,0.002967,-0.014103,0.00142,0.029663,-0.025981,0.037506,0.063759,0.01001,-0.053947,0.033142,0.00061,0.046233,-0.000783,-0.044182,0.075891,-0.013367,-0.106804,0.049262,-0.027978,0.004053,0.034212,-0.022906,0.043049,0.024585,0.031588,0.059655,0.03019,-0.053475,-0.065002,0.1422,0.027155,-0.005494,0.013634,-0.038004,-0.028121,0.049234,0.009039,-0.037026,0.050364,-0.009244,0.046003,0.022949,-0.007905,0.010669,0.003691,-0.003804,-0.033779,0.055635,0.064111,-0.107279,0.010094,-0.005627,-0.003385,-0.040047,-0.015407,0.010406,0.029951,-0.015003,0.023982,-0.032545,-0.039122,-0.022257,0.010715,0.01306,0.04648,0.103543,-0.014367,0.044713,-0.036692,-0.042152,0.006571,-0.022967,0.017891,0.033599,-0.042199,-0.043682,0.016101,0