('4a2cc873-e4d0-47af-ae3e-26edf2c04a84', null, 'public_demo', 9, '## Competitive landscape

The main alternatives are general-purpose document tools and chat-based note bots. General-purpose tools are flexible but have weak search for decisions. Chat-based bots capture text but do not organise it. Orbit Notes focuses on one job: making past decisions easy to find and trust.

Competitor team plans range from 5 to 10 dollars per member per month, which is why the price is set at 8 dollars.', '[-0.059667,-0.00817,-0.010184,-0.014083,-0.041575,-0.02914,-0.018276,0.051217,0.00273,0.005527,0.030965,0.095374,0.018553,-0.002274,-0.03824,-0.090818,-0.008075,-0.052761,0.090071,0.073778,0.026679,-0.038095,-0.033881,-0.023472,0.025176,0.070073,-0.078817,-0.044366,-0.037753,-0.155445,0.019886,0.00555,0.039658,-0.006072,-0.055713,0.061033,0.014708,-0.04301,0.004915,0.017435,0.009863,0.040454,-0.061907,0.015739,0.004029,-0.045157,-0.021984,-0.014716,-0.030546,0.024566,0.008058,-0.008872,0.003611,0.015522,-0.013576,-0.002077,0.030167,0.003472,-0.006626,-0.004063,-0.002984,-0.049642,-0.134218,0.088442,-0.076562,0.023766,-0.018607,0.04035,-0.026193,0.061192,0.015828,0.020129,-0.029417,0.013206,0.016982,0.003294,-0.057442,-0.022947,0.046792,-0.017801,-0.052894,-0.037494,-0.04987,0.035848,-0.014662,-0.031299,0.054034,0.023063,0.005676,-0.013502,0.076433,0.031994,0.015094,-0.005112,0.001441,-0.007174,0.004704,0.012846,-0.083736,0.414994,-0.015142,0.017909,0.006495,-0.00852,0.01826,-0.070973,0.025143,-0.041706,-0.008757,0.051212,-0.006377,0.02741,0.004365,-0.037639,-0.049322,0.007905,0.024637,-0.038334,0.060878,0.018179,-0.05572,-0.010246,0.03221,0.061529,-0.021253,0.052646,0.022045,0.066876,0.005403,0.025204,0.101556,-0.035206,-0.076728,0.01678,0.043423,-0.011169,0.026663,-0.042293,-0.008246,0.035407,-0.000773,-0.002565,0.065742,-0.019281,-0.03439,0.116637,0.056118,0.029063,-0.025281,-0.019657,-0.007419,0.017222,0.063389,0.012755,-0.030315,0.00716,0.02571,0.00395,-0.097384,0.004668,-0.030715,0.039926,-0.066964,0.109498,0.045998,-0.149584,-0.049531,-0.034926,-0.028116,-0.011493,-0.00768,-0.052138,0.032655,0.008612,0.078821,0.005759,-0.061851,-0.023824,0.015501,0.033351,0.02114,0.013841,-0.028818,-0.018862,-0.052605,-0.002148,-0.017072,0.001514,0.056082,-0.010991,-0.046683,0.025233,0.00236,0.08582,-0.046644,0.006863,-0.040063,-0.066879,-0.04825,-0.004256,0.05