('4a2cc873-e4d0-47af-ae3e-26edf2c04a84', null, 'public_demo', 10, '## Success metrics

The team will judge the MVP on four measures:

- At least 60 percent of beta teams still active after 8 weeks.
- Median time to find a past decision under 60 seconds.
- Decision extraction accepted without edits at least 85 percent of the time.
- At least 30 percent of workspaces invite 5 or more members in the first month.', '[-0.070761,0.002298,-0.017686,-0.055078,-0.016487,0.050437,0.048794,0.003884,0.040436,0.061185,0.02916,0.026041,-0.000087,0.005164,-0.057914,-0.009175,-0.031663,-0.063828,0.013767,0.013135,-0.004782,-0.0484,0.002909,0.006454,0.075428,0.035422,-0.026497,-0.045136,-0.096697,-0.183764,-0.07263,-0.057427,0.129257,0.006474,-0.039187,0.040712,0.014777,0.010943,-0.008455,0.001294,0.038546,0.015345,-0.008425,-0.006245,-0.051041,0.020009,-0.003861,-0.065475,0.002625,0.064846,0.015665,-0.027785,0.040817,0.069195,0.000957,0.011106,0.038962,0.039904,0.050795,-0.037552,0.025743,-0.020836,-0.135542,0.037607,-0.039263,0.033476,-0.045514,-0.102099,-0.027265,0.00332,0.048034,0.060702,0.007061,-0.012513,0.03475,0.05639,0.019568,0.008472,0.059665,-0.007845,-0.049772,0.029681,-0.025089,-0.030524,0.011825,0.009031,0.048811,0.064266,0.014154,0.054652,0.017008,0.033069,-0.050282,0.01872,-0.039087,-0.014305,0.003403,-0.036432,-0.0352,0.36885,-0.067944,0.07979,-0.064582,0.001059,0.025785,-0.049117,0.033334,0.02395,-0.007946,0.063142,-0.037644,0.019007,0.067693,-0.033675,-0.007924,0.091424,-0.057416,0.031448,-0.000379,-0.051815,-0.001996,0.052743,0.075788,-0.019474,-0.02137,0.066768,0.074331,0.069599,0.043354,0.034444,0.076709,0.023214,-0.09599,-0.01505,0.003615,-0.001927,0.015519,0.021117,-0.019374,-0.047326,0.035801,0.007551,0.097741,-0.063465,-0.045855,0.112019,-0.058748,-0.00066,0.018117,-0.058612,-0.042825,0.054821,-0.031458,-0.01481,0.00034,0.01373,-0.002682,-0.020415,-0.061518,0.016453,-0.067564,0.005406,-0.013777,0.034634,0.015299,-0.011678,0.017624,-0.038474,0.028634,0.024467,0.01889,-0.020681,0.028313,0.004358,0.043129,0.000721,0.009203,-0.003538,0.007954,-0.029502,0.075901,0.002349,-0.020509,0.039961,0.054066,0.015245,0.013184,-0.090241,0.038541,0.036169,-0.070624,-0.031454,-0.088963,0.061793,0.049857,-0.035887,-0.003682,-0.055075,-0.01979,0.027454,-0.080322,-0.045248,0.031041,-0.000151,0.008144,0.